        "current": "tailwind-css-v4-inceleme"
      },
      "excerpt": "A closer look at CSS-first configuration, the Oxide engine, and the new @theme directive in Tailwind CSS v4.",
      "publishedAt": "2026-03-28T09:00:00+03:00",
      "category": "Design",
      "tags": [
        "tailwindcss",
        "css",
        "frontend",
        "performance"
      ],
      "coverPath": "/assets/images/blog/tailwind-article.webp",
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "giris",
          "style": "h2",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-1",
              "text": "Why v4?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "source-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-3",
              "text": "Since 2019, Tailwind CSS has become one of the most popular utility-first CSS frameworks. But the JIT engine introduced in v3, the growing complexity of ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-4",
              "text": "tailwind.config.js",
              "marks": [
                "code"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-5",
              "text": " ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-6",
              "text": ", and the PostCSS dependency gave the team plenty of reasons to build something new from the ground up.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "source-7",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-8",
              "text": "The main goal of v4 is simple: ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-9",
              "text": "more speed, less configuration, and greater use of CSS standards",
              "marks": [
                "em"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-10",
              "text": ". And spoiler: it largely delivers.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "oxide-engine",
          "style": "h2",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-11",
              "text": "Oxide Engine",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "source-12",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-13",
              "text": "At the heart of v4 is ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-14",
              "text": "Oxide",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-15",
              "text": ", a new build engine written in Rust. This change brings a dramatic improvement in compilation times:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "benchmark",
          "_key": "source-16",
          "items": [
            {
              "_key": "source-17",
              "label": "Initial build",
              "before": "~1,500ms",
              "after": "~35ms",
              "improvement": "43× faster"
            },
            {
              "_key": "source-18",
              "label": "Incremental build",
              "before": "~150ms",
              "after": "~4ms",
              "improvement": "37× faster"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "notice",
          "_key": "source-19",
          "type": "info",
          "title": "How was this measured?",
          "body": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "source-20",
              "style": "normal",
              "markDefs": [],
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "source-21",
                  "text": "These figures come from Tailwind’s own benchmark tests. The ratios can vary with the size of a real project, but the overall trend is consistent.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "css-first",
          "style": "h2",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-22",
              "text": "The CSS-First Approach",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "source-23",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-24",
              "text": "In v3, configuration lived in JavaScript. v4 changes that approach: configuration now lives directly in your CSS file, starting with ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-25",
              "text": "@import \"tailwindcss\"",
              "marks": [
                "code"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-26",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "codeBlock",
          "_key": "source-27",
          "language": "css — v3 (old)",
          "code": "/* postcss.config.js */\nmodule.exports = {\n  plugins: {\n    tailwindcss: {},\n    autoprefixer: {},\n  },\n}\n\n/* tailwind.config.js */\nmodule.exports = {\n  content: ['./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}'],\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: { brand: '#0ea5e9' }\n    }\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "_type": "codeBlock",
          "_key": "source-28",
          "language": "css — v4 (new)",
          "code": "/* globals.css — everything in one file */\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: #0ea5e9;\n  --font-display: 'Geist', sans-serif;\n  --radius-card: 0.75rem;\n}"
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "source-29",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "source-30",
              "text": "With Vite, you can use the ",
